{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21533","headline":"永贞二年正月二日上御丹凤楼赦天下予与李公垂庾顺之闲行曲江不及盛观 · 元稹","name":"永贞二年正月二日上御丹凤楼赦天下予与李公垂庾顺之闲行曲江不及盛观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春来饶梦慵朝起，不看千官拥御楼。\n却着闲行是忙事，数人同傍曲江头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}